# Read docs first

Before answering or editing Teakflow code, read every file in `docs/` in this order:

1. `docs/README.md`
2. `docs/AGENTS.md`
3. `docs/spec.md`
4. `docs/THEME.md`
5. `docs/TASKS.md`

Do not invent features missing from `docs/spec.md`. Implement the next unchecked item in `docs/TASKS.md`. Put new documentation in `docs/`, not the repo root.
